{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the <strong>Department Of Obviously Overcomplicated Opening Operation Research Service</strong> \u2014 D.O.O.O.O.O.R.S., a research institution dedicated to the noble yet unnecessary science of opening and closing doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a newly appointed <strong>intern researcher</strong>, you will operate an old CRT monitoring terminal to remotely command Test Subjects through a series of rigorous yet absurd \u201cdoor control science\u201d experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Our motto:</strong><br><i>\u201cWhen God closes a door, we science it open.\u201d</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project D.O.O.O.O.O.R.S DEMO</strong> is a <strong>pure logic puzzle game</strong>.<br>Every move adheres to explicit rules and strict sequential logic \u2014 no action elements, no randomness, no hidden information. Only reasoning, experimentation, and the satisfaction of a perfectly deduced solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its core mechanic revolves around <i>\u201c<u>pressure pad activation \u2014 door opens</u>\u201d,</i> exploring countless variations of this simple dynamic: bridge doors, barrier doors, AND gates, NOT gates \u2014 all manifestations of door control science.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The design focuses on the <i>chemical reactions</i> between mechanisms, avoiding superfluous features to keep researchers fully engaged in the logic of <strong>state shifts, spatial manipulation, and temporal reasoning</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011250/extras/83e8a01c73ed134b00abf1226618fbc9.poster.avif?t=1762234349\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011250/extras/83e8a01c73ed134b00abf1226618fbc9.webm?t=1762234349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011250/extras/83e8a01c73ed134b00abf1226618fbc9.mp4?t=1762234349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distinct Atmosphere</strong> \u2014 DOS-like interface, CCTV surveillance feeds, and detached institutional documentation create a bizarrely immersive laboratory tone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist Mechanics</strong> \u2014 Built entirely upon \u201cpressure pad triggers door open,\u201d yet through overlapping rules and timing interplay, it forms dynamic spatial puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deadpan Humor</strong> \u2014 System prompts and research reports are delivered in an impeccably serious tone, laced with irony and bureaucratic absurdity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Box Carrying</strong> \u2014 Replacing traditional box-pushing with deliberate \u201cbox carrying,\u201d emphasizing strategic reasoning over mechanical repetition \u2014 the act of carrying becomes a logical operation in itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted Puzzles</strong> \u2014 Each experiment is uniquely designed, emphasizing deduction over brute force. Every solution is a product of reasoning, not luck.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011250/extras/1f0ce2132cab15c87a46d3aa7a0ac02a.poster.avif?t=1762234349\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011250/extras/1f0ce2132cab15c87a46d3aa7a0ac02a.webm?t=1762234349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011250/extras/1f0ce2132cab15c87a46d3aa7a0ac02a.mp4?t=1762234349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quality of Life</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time-sensitive inputs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad / keyboard support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most puzzles are optional</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic recording and replay of optimal solutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Post-experiment statistics (time, steps, undos, etc. \u2014 unrelated to victory conditions) for reflection and analysis</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Input buffering and configurable repeat delay for smoother operation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011250/extras/f87d0ebd05d54d0776f9512614b068d4.poster.avif?t=1762234349\" width=1170 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011250/extras/f87d0ebd05d54d0776f9512614b068d4.webm?t=1762234349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011250/extras/f87d0ebd05d54d0776f9512614b068d4.mp4?t=1762234349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEMO Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The DEMO includes <strong>3 early experiment groups</strong>, totaling <strong>23 puzzles</strong>, with an estimated playtime of <strong>around 2 hours</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >For Players Who\u2026</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Appreciate pure logic and the eureka moments born from mechanical interaction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the sterile, bureaucratic tone of experimental satire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Admire puzzle craftsmanship in games like <i>I Wanna Lockpick</i>, <i>Monster Expedition</i>, or <i>Stephen\u2019s Sausage Roll.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then welcome to <strong>Project D.O.O.O.O.O.R.S DEMO</strong> \u2014<br><strong>verify your logic, and test your sanity.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4011250?t=1762234349","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4011250?t=1762234349","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011250/e727e90eeacb8e5bcb8fe403a406a95c3d3b89ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762234349","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011250/e727e90eeacb8e5bcb8fe403a406a95c3d3b89ae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762234349","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the <strong>Department Of Obviously Overcomplicated Opening Operation Research Service</strong> \u2014 D.O.O.O.O.O.R.S., a research institution dedicated to the noble yet unnecessary science of opening and closing doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a newly appointed <strong>intern researcher</strong>, you will operate an old CRT monitoring terminal to remotely command Test Subjects through a series of rigorous yet absurd \u201cdoor control science\u201d experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Our motto:</strong><br><i>\u201cWhen God closes a door, we science it open.\u201d</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project D.O.O.O.O.O.R.S DEMO</strong> is a <strong>pure logic puzzle game</strong>.<br>Every move adheres to explicit rules and strict sequential logic \u2014 no action elements, no randomness, no hidden information. Only reasoning, experimentation, and the satisfaction of a perfectly deduced solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its core mechanic revolves around <i>\u201c<u>pressure pad activation \u2014 door opens</u>\u201d,</i> exploring countless variations of this simple dynamic: bridge doors, barrier doors, AND gates, NOT gates \u2014 all manifestations of door control science.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The design focuses on the <i>chemical reactions</i> between mechanisms, avoiding superfluous features to keep researchers fully engaged in the logic of <strong>state shifts, spatial manipulation, and temporal reasoning</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011250/extras/83e8a01c73ed134b00abf1226618fbc9.poster.avif?t=1762234349\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011250/extras/83e8a01c73ed134b00abf1226618fbc9.webm?t=1762234349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011250/extras/83e8a01c73ed134b00abf1226618fbc9.mp4?t=1762234349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distinct Atmosphere</strong> \u2014 DOS-like interface, CCTV surveillance feeds, and detached institutional documentation create a bizarrely immersive laboratory tone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist Mechanics</strong> \u2014 Built entirely upon \u201cpressure pad triggers door open,\u201d yet through overlapping rules and timing interplay, it forms dynamic spatial puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deadpan Humor</strong> \u2014 System prompts and research reports are delivered in an impeccably serious tone, laced with irony and bureaucratic absurdity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Box Carrying</strong> \u2014 Replacing traditional box-pushing with deliberate \u201cbox carrying,\u201d emphasizing strategic reasoning over mechanical repetition \u2014 the act of carrying becomes a logical operation in itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted Puzzles</strong> \u2014 Each experiment is uniquely designed, emphasizing deduction over brute force. Every solution is a product of reasoning, not luck.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011250/extras/1f0ce2132cab15c87a46d3aa7a0ac02a.poster.avif?t=1762234349\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011250/extras/1f0ce2132cab15c87a46d3aa7a0ac02a.webm?t=1762234349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011250/extras/1f0ce2132cab15c87a46d3aa7a0ac02a.mp4?t=1762234349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quality of Life</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time-sensitive inputs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad / keyboard support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most puzzles are optional</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic recording and replay of optimal solutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Post-experiment statistics (time, steps, undos, etc. \u2014 unrelated to victory conditions) for reflection and analysis</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Input buffering and configurable repeat delay for smoother operation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011250/extras/f87d0ebd05d54d0776f9512614b068d4.poster.avif?t=1762234349\" width=1170 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011250/extras/f87d0ebd05d54d0776f9512614b068d4.webm?t=1762234349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011250/extras/f87d0ebd05d54d0776f9512614b068d4.mp4?t=1762234349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEMO Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The DEMO includes <strong>3 early experiment groups</strong>, totaling <strong>23 puzzles</strong>, with an estimated playtime of <strong>around 2 hours</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >For Players Who\u2026</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Appreciate pure logic and the eureka moments born from mechanical interaction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the sterile, bureaucratic tone of experimental satire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Admire puzzle craftsmanship in games like <i>I Wanna Lockpick</i>, <i>Monster Expedition</i>, or <i>Stephen\u2019s Sausage Roll.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then welcome to <strong>Project D.O.O.O.O.O.R.S DEMO</strong> \u2014<br><strong>verify your logic, and test your sanity.</strong></p>","developers":["agoo"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3983590","name":"Project DOOOOORS"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011250/227db7c926f2bc48b5a04962404a9bb3472e36e2/header.jpg?t=1762234349","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements"